<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Enrollment Request Received</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px;">
    <h2>Hello <%= name %>,</h2>

    <p>
      We've received your enrollment request for
      <strong><%= courseTitle || "a physical program" %></strong>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our team will reach out shortly with next steps, class schedule, and
      orientation details.
    </p>

    <p>Your Request ID:</p>
    <pre
      style="
        background: #f4f4f4;
        padding: 10px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        display: inline-block;
      "
      ><%= requestId %></pre
    >

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
      If you did not make this request, ignore this message.
    </p>

    <p>Thank you.</p>
  </body>
</html>